/S /P
/ActualText (Nestled within the vibrant academic landscape of Telangana, Vignana Bharathi Institute of Technology stands tall as a beacon of innovation and learning, celebrated far and wide as one of the Top Engineering Colleges in the region.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2]
>>
