/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Established in 2020, The Computer Science and Business System \(CSBS\) department aims to offer inclusive technology education to students, fostering responsible citizenship for societal betterment. The department focuses on developing competent programmers. The department boasts well-equipped computing laboratories and a diverse array of software applications.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
