246 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Our department is not just about acquiring knowledge; it is about embracing innovation, fostering creativity, and developing skills that will shape your future.I encourage each and every one of you to make the most of this opportunity. Engage actively in your classes, collaborate with your peers, and seek out internships and projects that will enhance your learning experience. I am confident that with dedication, hard work, and a passion for learning, you will emerge from this program as confident and capable professionals ready to make a positive impact on the world. So, seize every opportunity, embrace every challenge, and never stop striving for greatness. I wish you all the best in your academic endeavors and look forward to witnessing your success. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
