/P 605 0 R
/ActualText (In a 24-hour hackathon organized by JNTU Hyderabad across 11 regions, held on June 22, 2022, at VBIT College, 38 teams participated. Among them, one team from Region 7 emerged triumphant, clinching the first prize in the domain of open innovation. Their winning project, "Man-at-Service," impressed judges with its ingenuity, promising to revolutionize service delivery. Congratulations to the victorious participant Harsha Aditya for his remarkable achievement!)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [1]
>>
