/T (Stories have a unique ability to transcend differences and create common ground. Whether through personal anecdotes, cultural myths, or shared experiences, they allow us to see the world through the eyes of others, fostering empathy and understanding in the process. In a diverse and increasingly fragmented society, this ability to cultivate empathy is essential for building strong, resilient communities.)
