/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/T (By providing a platform for marginalized perspectives, storytelling not only promotes inclusivity and diversity but also challenges existing power structures and fosters social change. Whether through literature, film, or digital media, stories have the power to shine a light on injustice, inspire action, and galvanize communities to work towards a more equitable future.)
/E (By providing a platform for marginalized perspectives, storytelling not only promotes inclusivity and diversity but also challenges existing power structures and fosters social change. Whether through literature, film, or digital media, stories have the power to shine a light on injustice, inspire action, and galvanize communities to work towards a more equitable future.)
